MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- contentSeries2029Identity: an explicit, bounded `admission` per series (exactAuthorAllPosts, approvedPostIds)
  with one rule for the row check (contentSeriesExclusionReason / contentSeriesAdmits) and the PostgREST
  filter (contentSeriesAdmissionFilter), so the query and the check cannot disagree.
- postsCatalog2029Projection / contentSeries2029Projection use that one filter instead of
  `.or(membership)` + `.eq("author")`; the other series' filters are unchanged.
- Identity verified 11.11.2026 (read-only): the 13 Posts embed or are written from the channel
  «אלון לוי - מה קורה הבורא»; 5003/5004 keep their categories and author field; no copies.
  The other category Posts of other publishers are not admitted.
- Tests updated where they encoded DEC-SERIES-005 (tag only) or DEC-SERIES-003 (5003/5004 excluded);
  new tests for both decisions and for the shared filter.
- CFC: a dated note after the 6.11 snapshot table; the PLAN37 record is pending (DB write, needs approval).

Branch-only. No DB write, no merge, no deployment. PR #1296 (draft) overlaps this file and is untouched.

